@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5082
@documentId = cache-recovery

### Add a runbook document
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=runbookBoundary

--runbookBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cache-recovery.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

# Cache recovery
Restart the cache service and verify its health before restoring traffic.
--runbookBoundary--

### Replace the same document ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=runbookBoundary

--runbookBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cache-recovery.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

# Cache recovery
Restart the cache service, verify health, and record the recovery outcome.
--runbookBoundary--

### List document metadata and status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents

### Delete an existing document
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}

### Deleting a missing document returns 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/missing-document
